## Personal knowledge base

For anything about my notes, 1:1s, engineering log, or synced call transcripts, WebFetch:

  `https://{{ includeTemplate "keeper-field" (list .keeper.kb "RB_HOST") }}/r/$RB_TOKEN/search?q=<url-encoded-query>&k=6`

`$RB_TOKEN` holds the token. Response is plain Markdown blocks separated by `---`. Retrieval only: synthesize the answer yourself from the chunks and cite the note paths shown.
